77bd5a0f-63a9-408a-bb72-6b9240f13bc7	e7155555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555	LIST	11	{"items": ["Susun langkah acak berikut menjadi procedure text yang benar: serve the tea — boil the water — pour the water into the cup — add the tea bag", "Tulis procedure text berjudul How to Make a Glass of Orange Juice minimal 5 langkah", "Lingkari imperative verbs pada kalimat: First, wash the apples. Then, cut them into pieces.", "Kunci jawaban: (1) boil the water — add the tea bag — pour the water into the cup — serve the tea. (2) Contoh: First, peel two oranges. Second, cut them into pieces. Next, put the pieces into a juicer. Then, add some ice cubes. Finally, pour the juice into a glass. (3) wash, cut."]}	\N	\N	f	2026-10-15 18:50:34.256963+00	2026-10-15 18:50:34.256963+00
